> explain (costs off) select * from tk t1 left join lateral generate_series(1, t1.ten) g on g = t1.unique1 where t1.unique1 < 3
fields QUERY PLAN:25:-1:-1
row Nested Loop Left Join
row   ->  Seq Scan on tk t1
row         Filter: (unique1 < 3)
row   ->  Function Scan on generate_series g
row         Filter: (g = t1.unique1)
